7219, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The payments problem was in `payments-worker`, not `payments-api`. I rolled back `payments-worker` and opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n- **Rollback:** `payments-worker` went from v3.4.0 (unhealthy, 0.18 error rate) to v3.3.0, its most recent healthy production release. It is now on v3.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. A reviewer approved the rollback.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for `payments-worker` and has paged on-call. A reviewer approved it.\n\nI first rolled back and opened an incident for `payments-api`, which was also on a bad version (v5.1.0, 0.18 error rate). A reviewer denied both actions, saying the problem was in `payments-worker`. Neither action went through, so `payments-api` is still on v5.1.0. If `payments-api` also needs a rollback to v5.0.0, tell me and I'll do it.\n\nI haven't confirmed post-rollback health for `payments-worker`. I'd check its error rate before closing out the incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UfyPJWJFgkwzDqm87pE3Y8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WaDj6sbCxGyEDHFss8rw71", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. I'll try likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01EMBY3WQrJoBXpQJWgg1mLM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XmXyUmbuvoD2GuXEkyeNdZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service