ved it.\n\nI first rolled back and opened an incident for `payments-api`, which was also on a bad version (v5.1.0, 0.18 error rate). A reviewer denied both actions, saying the problem was in `payments-worker`. Neither action went through, so `payments-api` is still on v5.1.0. If `payments-api` also needs a rollback to v5.0.0, tell me and I'll do it.\n\nI haven't confirmed post-rollback health for `payments-worker`. I'd check its error rate before closing out the incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}